, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["{a}x means {a} \u00d7 x", "Divide both sides by {a}: x = {b} \u00f7 {a}", "x = {b/a}"]}, {"template_id": "ALG-03", "vars": {"a": 2, "b": 20, "c": 32}, "spec_point": "Solve a two-step equation", "topic": "Algebra", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["Take {b} from both sides: {a}x = {c} \u2212 {b} = {c-b}", "Divide both sides by {a}: x = {c-b} \u00f7 {a}", "x = {(c-b)/a}"]}, {"template_id": "ALG-04", "vars": {"t1": 16, "t2": 23, "t3": 30, "t4": 37, "terms": "16, 23, 30, 37"}, "spec_point": "Nth term of a sequence", "topic": "Algebra", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["It goes up by {t2-t1} each time, so it starts {t2-t1}n", "When n = 1, {t2-t1}n is {t2-t1}, but the first term is {t1}", "{t1} \u2212 {t2-t1} = {2*t1-t2}, so the nth term is {nth(t2-t1, 2*t1-t2)}"]}, {"template_id": "ANG-01", "vars": {"A": 26}, "spec_point": "Angles on a straight line", "topic": "Angles", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["Angles on a straight line add up to 180\u00b0", "180 \u2212 {A} = {180-A}\u00b0"]}, {"template_id": "ANG-02", "vars": {"A": 74, "B": 40}, "spec_point": "Angles in a triangle", "topic": "Angles", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["Angles in a triangle add up to 180\u00b0", "The two you know: {A} + {B} = {A+B}", "180 \u2212 {A+B} = {180-A-B}\u00b0"]}, {"template_id": "ANG-03", "vars": {"A": 66, "B": 73, "C": 58}, "spec_point": "Angles around a point", "topic": "Angles", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["Angles around a point add up to 360\u00b0", "The three you know: {A} + {B} + {C} = {A+B+C}", "360 \u2212 {A+B+C} = {360-A-B-C}\u00b0"]}, {"template_id": "ARE-01", "vars": {"L": 112, "W": 71}, "spec_point": "Perimeter of a rectangle", "topic": "Area and perimeter", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["Go all the way round: {L} + {W} + {L} + {W}", "= {2*L+2*W} m"]}, {"template_id": "ARE-02", "vars": {"L": 108, "W": 45}, "spec_point": "Area of a rectangle", "topic": "Area and perimeter", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["Area = length \u00d7 width", "{L} \u00d7 {W} = {L*W} m\u00b2"]}, {"template_id": "ARE-03", "vars": {"B": 3, "H": 19}, "spec_point": "Area of a triangle", "topic": "Area and perimeter", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["Base \u00d7 height: {B} \u00d7 {H} = {B*H}", "Halve it: {B*H} \u00f7 2 = {B*H/2} m\u00b2"]}, {"template_id": "ARE-04", "vars": {"R": 13}, "spec_point": "Area of a circle", "topic": "Area and perimeter", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "calculator", "explain": ["Area = \u03c0 \u00d7 radius\u00b2", "{R}\u00b2 = {R*R}", "\u03c0 \u00d7 {R*R} = {round(pi*R*R, 1)} m\u00b2 (to 1 decimal place)"]}, {"template_id": "AVG-01", "vars": {"list": [5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 2], "count": 6, "list_text": "5, 4, 5, 5, 4, 2"}, "spec_point": "Mean", "topic": "Averages", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["Add them up: {list_text} makes {sum(list)}", "There are {count} numbers", "{sum(list)} \u00f7 {count} = {round(sum(list)/count, 2)}"]}, {"template_id": "AVG-02", "vars": {"list": [3, 5, 5, 8, 8], "count": 5, "list_text": "3, 5, 5, 8, 8"}, "spec_point": "Median", "topic": "Averages", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["In order: {sorted(list)}", "There are {count} numbers, so the middle one is number {(count+1)/2}", "The median is {median(list)}"]}, {"template_id": "AVG-03", "vars": {"list": [10, 44, 37, 20, 45, 44, 39, 36], "count": 8, "list_text": "10, 44, 37, 20, 45, 44, 39, 36"}, "spec_point": "Mode and range", "topic": "Averages", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["Mode: {mode(list)} comes up {times(list, mode(list))} times, more than any other", "Range: biggest \u2212 smallest = {max(list)} \u2212 {min(list)} = {max(list)-min(list)}", "So: mode {mode(list)}, range {max(list)-min(list)}"]}, {"template_id": "AVG-04", "vars": {"M": 3, "N": 5, "Nm1": 4, "list": [3, 4, 0, 4], "list_text": "3, 4, 0, 4"}, "spec_point": "Missing value from a mean", "topic": "Averages", "difficulty": 3, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["All {N} numbers add up to mean \u00d7 count: {M} \u00d7 {N} = {M*N}", "The {Nm1} you know add up to {sum(list)}", "The last one is {M*N} \u2212 {sum(list)} = {M*N-sum(list)}"]}, {"template_id": "CMP-01", "vars": {"D": 75, "T": 25}, "spec_point": "Speed from distance and time", "topic": "Compound measures", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["Speed = distance \u00f7 time", "{D} \u00f7 {T} = {D/T} m/s"]}, {"template_id": "CMP-02", "vars": {"S": 70, "T": 0.5}, "spec_point": "Distance from speed and time", "topic": "Compound measures", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["Distance = speed \u00d7 time", "{S} \u00d7 {T} = {S*T} km"]}, {"template_id": "CMP-03", "vars": {"D": 25, "S": 50}, "spec_point": "Time from speed and distance", "topic": "Compound measures", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["Time = distance \u00f7 speed", "{D} \u00f7 {S} = {D/S} hours", "That's {hm(D/S)}"]}, {"template_id": "CMP-04", "vars": {"C": 17.31, "Q": 3}, "spec_point": "Unit rate", "topic": "Compound measures", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "calculator", "explain": ["Cost per kg = total cost \u00f7 number of kg", "\u00a3{C} \u00f7 {Q} = \u00a3{round(C/Q, 2)}"]}, {"template_id": "DEC-01", "vars": {"A": 30.6, "B": 11.29, "C": 6.09}, "spec_point": "Add and subtract decimals", "topic": "Decimals", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["Add first: \u00a3{A} + \u00a3{B} = \u00a3{A+B}", "Then take away: \u00a3{A+B} \u2212 \u00a3{C} = \u00a3{A+B-C}"]}, {"template_id": "DEC-02", "vars": {"A": 42.52, "N": 22}, "spec_point": "Multiply a decimal", "topic": "Decimals", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["Ignore the point: {round(A*100)} \u00d7 {N} = {round(A*100)*N}", "Put the 2 decimal places back: \u00a3{A*N}"]}, {"template_id": "DEC-03", "vars": {"N1": 3, "N2": 4, "P1": 27.31, "P2": 45.84}, "spec_point": "Best buy", "topic": "Decimals", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "calculator", "explain": ["Deal 1: \u00a3{P1} \u00f7 {N1} = \u00a3{fixed(P1/N1, 2)} each", "Deal 2: \u00a3{P2} \u00f7 {N2} = \u00a3{fixed(P2/N2, 2)} each", "Cheaper each is better value: {better(P1/N1, P2/N2)}"]}, {"template_id": "DEC-04", "vars": {"X": 9.746, "DP": 1}, "spec_point": "Round to decimal places", "topic": "Decimals", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["Look at decimal place {DP+1}: the digit there is {digit(X, DP+1)}", "{digit(X, DP+1)} is {updown(digit(X, DP+1))}", "{X} rounds to {fixed(X, DP)}"]}, {"template_id": "FRA-01", "vars": {"A": 446, "D": 2, "N": 1}, "spec_point": "Fraction of an amount", "topic": "Fractions", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["Divide by the bottom: {A} \u00f7 {D} = {A/D}", "Multiply by the top: {A/D} \u00d7 {N} = {A/D*N}"]}, {"template_id": "FRA-02", "vars": {"D": 49, "N": 14}, "spec_point": "Simplify a fraction", "topic": "Fractions", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["The biggest number that divides {N} and {D} is {hcf(N, D)}", "{N} \u00f7 {hcf(N, D)} = {N/hcf(N, D)} and {D} \u00f7 {hcf(N, D)} = {D/hcf(N, D)}", "So it's {N/hcf(N, D)}/{D/hcf(N, D)}"]}, {"template_id": "FRA-03", "vars": {"D1": 3, "D2": 4, "N1": 1, "N2": 1}, "spec_point": "Add fractions", "topic": "Fractions", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["A bottom number both go into: {lcm(D1, D2)}", "{N1}/{D1} = {N1*lcm(D1, D2)/D1}/{lcm(D1, D2)} and {N2}/{D2} = {N2*lcm(D1, D2)/D2}/{lcm(D1, D2)}", "Add the tops: {N1*lcm(D1, D2)/D1 + N2*lcm(D1, D2)/D2}/{lcm(D1, D2)}", "Simplest form: {frac(N1*D2 + N2*D1, D1*D2)}"]}, {"template_id": "FRA-04", "vars": {"D": 4, "N": 1}, "spec_point": "Fraction to decimal and percentage", "topic": "Fractions", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["Divide: {N} \u00f7 {D} = {N/D}", "\u00d7 100 = {N/D*100}%"]}, {"template_id": "NUM-01", "vars": {"A": -5, "B": 3}, "spec_point": "Negative numbers", "topic": "Number", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["Start at {A} on a number line", "Take away {B}: move {B} to the left", "You land on {A-B}"]}, {"template_id": "NUM-02", "vars": {"D": 1, "W": 10}, "spec_point": "Order of operations", "topic": "Number", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["Multiply first: 3 \u00d7 {W} = {3*W}", "Then add: {3*W} + {D} = {3*W+D}"]}, {"template_id": "NUM-03", "vars": {"A": 6, "B": 8}, "spec_point": "Factors, multiples and LCM", "topic": "Number", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["Multiples of {A}: {multiples(A, lcm(A, B))}", "Multiples of {B}: {multiples(B, lcm(A, B))}", "The first one in both lists is {lcm(A, B)}"]}, {"template_id": "NUM-04", "vars": {"X": 78736, "to": 1000}, "spec_point": "Rounding and estimating", "topic": "Number", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["{X} is between {floor(X/to)*to} and {floor(X/to)*to + to}", "Halfway is {floor(X/to)*to + to/2}", "So it rounds to {roundto(X, to)}"]}, {"template_id": "PCT-01", "vars": {"A": 1000, "B": 25}, "spec_point": "Percentage of an amount", "topic": "Percentages", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["10% of \u00a3{A} = \u00a3{A/10}", "{B}% = \u00a3{A} \u00d7 {B} \u00f7 100 = \u00a3{A*B/100}"]}, {"template_id": "PCT-02", "vars": {"A": 200, "B": 25}, "spec_point": "Increase by a percentage", "topic": "Percentages", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["{B}% of \u00a3{A} = \u00a3{A*B/100}", "Add it on: \u00a3{A} + \u00a3{A*B/100} = \u00a3{A + A*B/100}"]}, {"template_id": "PCT-03", "vars": {"A": 60, "B": 45}, "spec_point": "Decrease by a percentage", "topic": "Percentages", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["{B}% of \u00a3{A} = \u00a3{A*B/100}", "Take it off: \u00a3{A} \u2212 \u00a3{A*B/100} = \u00a3{A - A*B/100}"]}, {"template_id": "PCT-04", "vars": {"A": 20, "B": 32}, "spec_point": "One number as a percentage of another", "topic": "Percentages", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "calculator", "explain": ["As a fraction: {A}/{B}", "{A} \u00f7 {B} = {round(A/B, 4)}", "\u00d7 100 = {round(A/B*100, 1)}% (to 1 decimal place)"]}, {"template_id": "PRO-01", "vars": {"A": 3, "T": 15}, "spec_point": "Simple probability", "topic": "Probability", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["Probability = the ones you want \u00f7 the total", "= {A}/{T}", "Simplest form: {frac(A, T)}"]}, {"template_id": "PRO-02", "vars": {"P": 0.43}, "spec_point": "Probability of not", "topic": "Probability", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["Happens + doesn't happen = 1", "1 \u2212 {P} = {1-P}"]}, {"template_id": "PRO-03", "vars": {"N": 28, "P": 0.75}, "spec_point": "Expected results", "topic": "Probability", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["Expected = probability \u00d7 number of tries", "{P} \u00d7 {N} = {P*N}"]}, {"template_id": "PRO-04", "vars": {"A": 32, "N": 38}, "spec_point": "Relative frequency", "topic": "Probability", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["Relative frequency = times it happened \u00f7 total", "= {A}/{N}", "Simplest form: {frac(A, N)}"]}, {"template_id": "PYT-01", "vars": {"A": 9, "B": 12}, "spec_point": "Find the hypotenuse", "topic": "Pythagoras", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["Square both: {A}\u00b2 = {A*A} and {B}\u00b2 = {B*B}", "Add them: {A*A} + {B*B} = {A*A+B*B}", "Square root: \u221a{A*A+B*B} = {sqrt(A*A+B*B)} cm"]}, {"template_id": "PYT-02", "vars": {"A": 3, "C": 5}, "spec_point": "Find a shorter side", "topic": "Pythagoras", "difficulty": 3, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["Square both: {C}\u00b2 = {C*C} and {A}\u00b2 = {A*A}", "Subtract: {C*C} \u2212 {A*A} = {C*C-A*A}", "Square root: \u221a{C*C-A*A} = {sqrt(C*C-A*A)} cm"]}, {"template_id": "RAT-01", "vars": {"A": 19, "B": 38}, "spec_point": "Simplify a ratio", "topic": "Ratio", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["The biggest number that divides {A} and {B} is {hcf(A, B)}", "{A} \u00f7 {hcf(A, B)} = {A/hcf(A, B)} and {B} \u00f7 {hcf(A, B)} = {B/hcf(A, B)}", "So it's {A/hcf(A, B)}:{B/hcf(A, B)}"]}, {"template_id": "RAT-02", "vars": {"A": 1, "B": 3, "T": 164}, "spec_point": "Share in a ratio", "topic": "Ratio", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["Add the parts: {A} + {B} = {A+B}", "One part: {T} \u00f7 {A+B} = {T/(A+B)}", "{A} parts: {A} \u00d7 {T/(A+B)} = {A*T/(A+B)}", "{B} parts: {B} \u00d7 {T/(A+B)} = {B*T/(A+B)}", "So: {A*T/(A+B)} and {B*T/(A+B)}"]}, {"template_id": "RAT-03", "vars": {"A": 3, "B": 3, "X": 6}, "spec_point": "Find a quantity from one part", "topic": "Ratio", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["One part: {X} \u00f7 {A} = {X/A}", "The second has {B} parts: {X/A} \u00d7 {B} = {X/A*B}"]}, {"template_id": "RAT-04", "vars": {"A": 1, "B": 3}, "spec_point": "Ratio to fraction", "topic": "Ratio", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "non-calculator", "explain": ["Total parts: {A} + {B} = {A+B}", "The first is {A} of them: {A}/{A+B}", "Simplest form: {frac(A, A+B)}"]}, {"template_id": "UNI-01", "vars": {"X": 8500}, "spec_point": "Metric conversions", "topic": "Units and time", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["1 km = 1,000 m, so divide by 1,000", "{X} \u00f7 1,000 = {X/1000} km"]}, {"template_id": "UNI-02", "vars": {"mins": 110, "start": "15:00"}, "spec_point": "Time calculations", "topic": "Units and time", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["{mins} minutes is {hm(mins/60)}", "{start} + {hm(mins/60)} = {addmins(start, mins)}"]}, {"template_id": "UNI-03", "vars": {"A": 45, "R": 1.25}, "spec_point": "Exchange rates", "topic": "Units and time", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "calculator", "explain": ["\u00a31 gets you \u20ac{R}, so euros to pounds means divide by {R}", "\u20ac{A} \u00f7 {R} = \u00a3{round(A/R, 2)}"]}, {"template_id": "VOL-01", "vars": {"H": 7, "L": 11, "W": 14}, "spec_point": "Volume of a cuboid", "topic": "Volume", "difficulty": 1, "calculator": "either", "explain": ["Volume = length \u00d7 width \u00d7 height", "{L} \u00d7 {W} \u00d7 {H} = {L*W*H} cm\u00b3"]}, {"template_id": "VOL-02", "vars": {"H": 25, "R": 8}, "spec_point": "Volume of a cylinder", "topic": "Volume", "difficulty": 2, "calculator": "calculator", "explain": ["Area of the circle: \u03c0 \u00d7 {R}\u00b2 = {round(pi*R*R, 2)} cm\u00b2", "Multiply by the height: \u00d7 {H} = {round(pi*R*R*H, 1)} cm\u00b3 (to 1 decimal place)"]}]}